      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>“Gebet für den Landesfürsten” was written by Max Emanuel Stern and published in his anthology of teḥinot <tei:hi rend="italic">Die fromme Ẓionstochter: Andachtsbuch für Israels Frauen und Mädchen...</tei:hi> (1841), pp. 32-35. In its 1846 printing, the prayer is found on pp. 34-36.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>We welcome corrections and improvements. The transcription of the German from Latin script in Fraktur type provided machine-readable text for a machine translation by DeepL, which we then edited for accuracy and clarity. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_42413_notes"/>
